---
// Short label above a heading. Light text on a tinted pill: small green text
// on the dark background scores APCA Lc ~55, below the body text minimum.
---

<p class="mb-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand-base/30 bg-brand-base/10 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-100">
  <span aria-hidden="true" class="h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-neon"></span>
  <slot />
</p>
